{"type":"message","id":"d7df193a","parentId":"95404779","timestamp":"2026-06-26T22:02:27.676Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:7890734506\",\n  \"message_id\": \"296\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"7890734506\",\n  \"sender\": \"Lee Hyungjun\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-06-27 07:02 GMT+9\",\n  \"inbound_event_kind\": \"user_request\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Lee Hyungjun (7890734506)\",\n  \"id\": \"7890734506\",\n  \"name\": \"Lee Hyungjun\",\n  \"username\": \"richdadtechtree\"\n}\n```\n\nConversation context (untrusted, chronological, selected for current message):\n#251 Fri 2026-06-26 08:53 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 범어자이 매물보고는 이제 하지마\n#255 Fri 2026-06-26 08:54 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 오늘 영월 날씨 좀 알려줘\n#258 Fri 2026-06-26 09:17 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 코스닥이 전고점 대비 30% 내려가면 나에게 알려줘 지금 약 29% 가까이 내려왔어!!\n#261 Fri 2026-06-26 09:18 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 실시간으로 감시는 안될까?\n#263 Fri 2026-06-26 09:19 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 오키\n#267 Fri 2026-06-26 10:01 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 넘어서면 알려주고 아니면 알려주지마\n#270 Fri 2026-06-26 12:02 GMT+9 Lee Hyungjun: 40% 이하로 가면 또 알려줘\n\n코스닥 보고는 주말은 하지말고 30%구간 이미 돌파했으니 하지마!!\n그리고 당일 2% 이상 상승이나 하락이 있을때만 보고해줘"}],"timestamp":1782511347673}}
{"type":"message","id":"53db5551","parentId":"d7df193a","timestamp":"2026-06-26T22:02:29.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<think>\n1.  **Analyze User Request:**\n    *   Sender: Lee Hyungjun.\n    *   Current Context: Stop reporting KOSDAQ at 30% (it's already passed).\n    *   New Request: Only report when there's a daily change of ±2% or more.\n    *   Constraint: No reports on weekends.\n    *   Request: \"40% 이하로 가면 또 알려줘\" (Notify if it drops below 40%).\n\n2.  **Analyze Current State:**\n    *   Need to update the KOSDAQ monitoring logic.\n    *   Constraints:\n        *   Ignore weekends (Saturday, Sunday).\n        *   Only report if daily volatility >= ±2%.\n        *   Report specifically if it drops below 40% (the 30% alert is now off).\n\n3.  **Plan:**\n    *   Check current cron jobs to see how KOSDAQ monitoring is implemented.\n    *   Update/create the monitor job to reflect these new constraints.\n    *   Inform the user of the update.\n\n4.  **Action - Check Crons:**\n    *   List current cron jobs.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"E8RcOOjB","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"list"},"thoughtSignature":"EjQKMgEMOdbHkjveLStECQDZVIR7C2RezwiFXbVFhWW7OyTknH43p7gasADvMiA4xEBzm2gc"},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","usage":{"input":15922,"output":273,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16195,"cost":{"input":0.0039805,"output":0.00040950000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00439}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782511347683,"responseId":"9PY-arXxD8m80-kP-PC68Qk"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7bf75d3d","parentId":"53db5551","timestamp":"2026-06-26T22:02:30.045Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"E8RcOOjB","toolName":"cron","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e396b175-2678-44a8-b840-50fd487152ee\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"KOSDAQ Drop Monitor (Hourly)\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1782433191064,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 * * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 300000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"현재 KOSDAQ 지수를 확인해줘. 1. 지수가 약 816(전고점 1,360 대비 40% 하락) 이하인가? 그렇다면 '심각한 하락(40% 하락)' 경고 메시지를 형준 님에게 보내줘. 2. 지수가 약 952(전고점 1,360 대비 30% 하락) 이하인가? 그렇다면 '하락(30% 하락)' 경고 메시지를 형준 님에게 보내줘. 3. 그 외(952 초과)라면 절대 아무 메시지도 보내지 마 (NO_REPLY를 준수해줘). 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지하되, 경고가 아닐 때는 침묵을 지켜줘.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\",\n        \"to\": \"7890734506\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1782514852677,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1782511252683,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 11540,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastFailureNotificationDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"consecutiveSkipped\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      },\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1782511264223\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7288d228-3e86-47b0-af67-59e7a057e356\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"Daily Weather Report\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1780264783242,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 6 * * *\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"강릉의 오늘 날씨를 확인해서 보고해줘. 체감 온도를 고려해서 어떤 옷을 입으면 좋을지도 추천해줘. 형준 님에게 직접 보고하는 형식이니 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지해줘.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"to\": \"7890734506\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1782594000000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1782507600020,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 48020,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"lastFailureNotificationDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"consecutiveSkipped\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      },\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1782507648040\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2e59001e-5be0-4d04-b1f6-7558844f33cf\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:telegram:direct:7890734506\",\n      \"name\": \"Daily Economy News Summary\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1779446630472,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 7 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"오늘의 핵심 경제 뉴스 10개를 검색해서 마크다운 형식으로 요약해줘. 각 뉴스에 대한 요약과 함께 원문 링크를 포함해줘. 형준 님에게 직접 보고하는 형식이니 뚜떵또의 말투(영리하고 유머러스함)를 유지해줘.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"telegram\",\n        \"to\": \"7890734506\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1782597600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1782511200020,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurati