{"type":"message","id":"66fc15a1","parentId":"d6f841b0","timestamp":"2026-06-26T22:02:35.564Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"1.  **Summarize Actions:**\n    *   Updated the KOSDAQ monitoring cron job (`e396b175-2678-44a8-b840-50fd487152ee`).\n    *   Set the schedule to run only on weekdays (Monday-Friday, `0 * * * 1-5`).\n    *   Updated the logic in the payload:\n        *   Report if index <= 40% drop (approx 816).\n        *   Report if daily volatility >= ±2%.\n        *   Maintain the requested persona.\n        *   Ensure quiet operation (NO_REPLY) when conditions are not met.\n2.  **Compose Reply:**\n    *   Confirm the changes to the user (Lee Hyungjun).\n    *   Keep it concise and friendly, in Ttutteongtto's style."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>형준 님, 확인했습니다! 코스닥 모니터링 규칙을 깔끔하게 수정했어요. 🧐\n\n1. **주말엔 쉼:** 평일(월~금)에만 모니터링합니다.\n2. **변동성 알림:** 당일 2% 이상 상승하거나 하락할 때만 알려드려요.\n3. **위험 알림:** 40% 하락 구간(지수 약 816 이하) 진입 시 즉시 보고할게요.\n\n30% 구간은 이미 지나갔으니 알림 끄고, 이제 변동성 위주로 조용히 지켜보다가 꼭 필요한 순간에만 나타날게요! ✨</final>"}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","usage":{"input":2721,"output":367,"cacheRead":16526,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19614,"cost":{"input":0.00068025,"output":0.0005505,"cacheRead":0.00041315000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0016439000000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782511353229,"responseId":"-fY-aufTKJnQ0-kP0cOjqAE"}}
